{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015AgDcracFTEAc25RhpnbHj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! I'm making good progress. I have 12 out of 52 features completed (23.1%). \n\nNow I should continue with the remaining coaching features and dashboard features. The most impactful next steps would be:\n\n1. COACH-002: Budget Optimization Recommendations (depends on COACH-001)\n2. COACH-003: Creative Refresh Recommendations (depends on COACH-001)\n3. COACH-004: Audience Targeting Recommendations (depends on COACH-001)\n4. COACH-005: Recommendation Scoring & Ranking (depends on COACH-001)\n5. COACH-006: Recommendation History & Tracking (depends on COACH-005)\n\nThen move to dashboard features and reporting. However, given the scale of the project and the number of remaining features, I should be strategic about which features to implement to maximize value.\n\nLet me implement a few more key features and then focus on getting the project deployable. Let me prioritize:\n\n1. Complete the recommendation system with all rule types (COACH-002-006)\n2. Create basic dashboard pages to display accounts and recommendations\n3. Implement API-level monitoring and health checks\n4. Prepare for Vercel deployment (DEPLOY-001)\n\nLet me create endpoints for retrieving recommendations and implement the remaining coaching rules.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":433,"cache_read_input_tokens":156774,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":433},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55793a17-4f50-4b66-a54a-24d9bccc2747","uuid":"51682836-ebe2-4fef-81cf-dadd57bd4469"}
