{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user requested completion of the MetaCoach Meta Ads coaching platform to production-ready state with:\n   - All features implemented according to the specification\n   - Functional /api/health endpoint\n   - Tests passing\n   - Project deployable to production\n   - The project has 52 features across 6 phases that needed systematic implementation\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Next.js 16.1.1 full-stack framework with React 19.2.3\n   - Supabase PostgreSQL database with Row Level Security policies\n   - Meta Graph API v21.0 for OAuth and ad account data\n   - JWT-based authentication with Supabase Auth\n   - Recommendation engine using rules-based analysis\n   - API endpoints for health checks, authentication, Meta integration, metrics fetching, and recommendation generation\n   - Vercel deployment configuration\n   - Environment-based configuration management\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   **Database & Core Infrastructure**:\n   - Supabase migrations (001_users_table, 002_meta_accounts_table, 003_campaigns_adsets_ads_tables, 004_metacoach_ad_schema)\n     - Created comprehensive schema with users, meta_accounts, meta_ad_sets, meta_ads, meta_ad_performance, meta_coach_recommendations, meta_coach_alerts tables\n     - Implemented indexing for performance\n     - Set up RLS policies for data security\n   \n   **Authentication Endpoints**:\n   - `/app/api/auth/signup/route.ts` - POST endpoint for user registration with email validation and Supabase Auth user creation\n   - `/app/api/auth/login/route.ts` - POST endpoint for user authentication with JWT token generation and secure cookie setting\n   - `/app/api/auth/logout/route.ts` - POST endpoint to clear auth tokens\n   - `/app/api/auth/forgot-password/route.ts` - POST endpoint to initiate password reset flow\n   - `/app/api/auth/reset-password/route.ts` - POST endpoint to complete password reset with token verification\n   \n   **Auth Middleware**:\n   - `/lib/auth-middleware.ts` - JWT token verification utility with `verifyAuth()` function and `createProtectedRoute()` wrapper\n     ```typescript\n     export async function verifyAuth(req: NextRequest): Promise<{\n       authenticated: boolean\n       userId?: string\n       user?: AuthPayload\n       error?: string\n     }>\n     ```\n   \n   **Health & Monitoring**:\n   - `/app/api/health/route.ts` - GET endpoint returning health status with database connectivity checks and version info\n   \n   **Meta API Integration**:\n   - `/app/api/meta/oauth/callback/route.ts` - Modified to store tokens in Supabase meta_accounts table after OAuth flow\n   - `/app/api/meta/accounts/route.ts` - GET endpoint returning user's linked Meta ad accounts with balance enrichment\n     - Protected route requiring authentication\n     - Returns account list with currency, timezone, status, and balance information\n   \n   **Campaign & Metrics Sync**:\n   - `/app/api/meta/sync/campaigns/route.ts` - POST/GET endpoint to sync campaigns and ad sets from Meta API\n     - Fetches campaigns from Meta Graph API\n     - Stores in meta_ad_sets table\n     - Includes error handling for sync failures\n   - `/app/api/meta/metrics/fetch/route.ts` - GET endpoint to fetch ad performance metrics\n     - Fetches metrics from Meta API with date range filtering\n     - Calculates CTR, CPC, CPA, ROAS metrics\n     - Stores metrics in meta_ad_performance table with upsert\n   \n   **Recommendation System**:\n   - `/lib/recommendation-engine.ts` - Core recommendation generation engine\n     ```typescript\n     export class RecommendationEngine {\n       async generateRecommendations(accountId: string): Promise<Recommendation[]>\n       private generateBudgetRecommendations(metrics: any[]): Recommendation[]\n       private generateCreativeRecommendations(metrics: any[]): Recommendation[]\n       private generateAudienceRecommendations(metrics: any[]): Recommendation[]\n       scoreRecommendations(recommendations: Recommendation[]): Recommendation[]\n     }\n     ```\n     - Implements rules for budget optimization, creative fatigue detection, audience expansion\n     - Calculates confidence scores and estimated impact\n     - Ranks recommendations by ROI potential\n   \n   - `/app/api/recommendations/generate/route.ts` - GET/POST endpoint to generate recommendations\n     - Protected route using createProtectedRoute\n     - Calls RecommendationEngine.generateRecommendations()\n     - Stores recommendations in meta_coach_recommendations table\n   \n   - `/app/api/recommendations/list/route.ts` - GET endpoint to retrieve stored recommendations\n     - Supports filtering by type and implementation status\n     - Returns summary statistics\n   \n   - `/app/api/recommendations/update/route.ts` - POST/PATCH endpoint to update recommendation status\n     - Marks recommendations as implemented\n     - Records implementation timestamp\n   \n   **Configuration Files**:\n   - `/package.json` - Updated dependencies:\n     - Added: zod (^3.23.8) for validation, jose (^5.2.4) for JWT\n     - Updated with build scripts and dev dependencies\n   \n   - `/.env.local` - Environment configuration with:\n     - Supabase credentials (URL, anon key, service role key)\n     - Meta API credentials (app ID, secret, redirect URL)\n     - Server configuration (port, base URL)\n   \n   - `/.env.example` - Template for environment variables setup\n   \n   - `/vercel.json` - Vercel deployment configuration\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"buildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n       \"installCommand\": \"npm install\",\n       \"framework\": \"nextjs\",\n       \"env\": {\n         \"NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL\": \"@next_public_supabase_url\",\n         \"NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\": \"@next_public_supabase_anon_key\",\n         ...\n       },\n       \"redirects\": [{\"source\": \"/\", \"destination\": \"/dashboard\"}]\n     }\n     ```\n   \n   **Documentation**:\n   - `/README_IMPLEMENTATION.md` - Comprehensive implementation status documenting:\n     - 24/52 features completed (46.2%)\n     - All implemented features by phase\n     - 26 total API endpoints\n     - Technology stack\n     - Environment configuration requirements\n     - Project structure\n     - Remaining features (28)\n     - Known limitations\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Supabase Foreign Key Type Mismatch Error**: \"ERROR: 42804: foreign key constraint cannot be implemented. Key columns 'campaign_id' and 'id' are of incompatible types: text and uuid\"\n     - Root cause: Existing `campaigns` table in shared Supabase project has UUID primary key, but attempted to create TEXT foreign keys\n     - Fix: Created separate MetaCoach tables with `meta_` prefix (meta_ad_sets, meta_ads, etc.) with all columns as TEXT to avoid conflicts\n   \n   - **Invalid Supabase Auth API Method**: \"Property 'getUserBySub' does not exist on type 'GoTrueAdminApi'\"\n     - Root cause: Attempted to use non-existent Supabase method `getUserBySub()`\n     - Fix: Changed to use `supabase.auth.getUser()` with proper authorization header\n   \n   - **Supabase Query Builder Promise Error**: \"Property 'catch' does not exist on type 'PostgrestFilterBuilder'\"\n     - Root cause: Attempted to use Promise `.catch()` method on Supabase query builder which returns a different object\n     - Fix: Used destructuring pattern `const { error } = await supabase.from(...).upsert(...)` to handle errors properly\n   \n   - **Missing Dependencies**: zod and jose packages not initially installed but referenced in code\n     - Fix: Added `zod@^3.23.8` and `jose@^5.2.4` to package.json dependencies\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - **Shared Database Namespace Conflict**: The Supabase project is shared across multiple services (ACTP, Media Vault, etc.), causing conflicts with table names like `campaigns`, `users`, `reports`. Resolved by creating MetaCoach-specific table names with `meta_coach_` or `meta_` prefixes to avoid collisions.\n   - **OAuth Token Storage**: Initially stored tokens in cookies only. Enhanced to store in Supabase table for better security and multi-device support.\n   - **API Authentication**: Created reusable `createProtectedRoute()` wrapper to enforce JWT verification across all protected endpoints.\n   - **Recommendation Engine**: Built comprehensive rule-based system covering budget optimization, creative fatigue, and audience targeting with automatic scoring and ranking.\n   - **Build Process**: Ensured all 26 API routes compile successfully with zero TypeScript errors and zero security vulnerabilities (after npm audit fix).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - User provided one comprehensive context message at the beginning with:\n     - The CLAUDE.md global ecosystem configuration\n     - MetaCoach project overview and requirements\n     - Feature tracking file location\n     - Goal: \"Complete all features to production-ready state, ensure /api/health works if applicable, tests pass, and the project is deployable\"\n   - No subsequent explicit user feedback or messages requiring course corrections\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Implement remaining 28 features across:\n     - Dashboard UI components (DASH-001 through COACH-UI-002) - 10 features\n     - Reporting system (REPORT-001 through REPORT-004) - 4 features\n     - Testing suite (TEST-001 through PERF-TEST-001) - 7 features\n     - Monitoring systems (MONITOR-001, MONITOR-002) - 2 features\n     - Additional features (FEATURE-001 through FEATURE-004) - 4 features\n   - Implement dashboard pages for displaying accounts and recommendations\n   - Add comprehensive test coverage\n   - Implement client reporting and PDF generation\n   - Set up error tracking and performance monitoring\n   - Deploy to Vercel product