{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cwz6fwth7BqbPz4T3HTTsA","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/MetaCoach/README_IMPLEMENTATION.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a7a6962-707b-432a-94ba-10b2e85c8b93","uuid":"4364e671-d7a7-4eca-87b8-3e5101f1d50a","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/MetaCoach/README_IMPLEMENTATION.md","oldString":"✅ **COACH-006** - Recommendation History & Tracking\n- `/api/recommendations/list` endpoint\n- `/api/recommendations/update` endpoint\n- Implementation status tracking\n\n### Deployment & Maintenance (4/4)","newString":"✅ **COACH-006** - Recommendation History & Tracking\n- `/api/recommendations/list` endpoint\n- `/api/recommendations/update` endpoint\n- Implementation status tracking\n\n### Phase 5: Client Dashboard & Reporting (7/12)\n✅ **DASH-001** - Dashboard Layout & Navigation\n- Main dashboard page with header and controls\n- Responsive grid layout\n- Account selector and time period controls\n- Clean, professional UI design\n\n✅ **DASH-002** - Account Selection & Switching\n- Dropdown selector for linked Meta ad accounts\n- Real-time metric updates on account switch\n- Account balance and currency display\n- Add account button for linking new accounts\n\n✅ **DASH-003** - Performance Summary Cards\n- Display spend, impressions, clicks, conversions\n- Icon indicators for each metric\n- Large typography for easy scanning\n- Color-coded metric cards (blue, green, purple, orange)\n\n✅ **DASH-004** - Performance Chart & Graphing\n- Interactive line charts using Recharts library\n- Support for spend, impressions, clicks, conversions\n- 7/30/90 day timeframe selector\n- Metric selector dropdown\n- Summary statistics (avg, peak, total) below chart\n\n✅ **DASH-005** - Campaign Performance Table\n- Table showing all campaigns with status\n- Status badges (ACTIVE/PAUSED)\n- Campaign objectives displayed\n- Responsive horizontal scrolling\n- Pagination for 100+ campaigns\n\n✅ **COACH-UI-001** - Recommendations Panel & Display\n- Top 5 recommendations displayed in list\n- Priority color indicators (high/medium/low)\n- Confidence scores and impact percentages\n- Clickable items to view details\n- Hover effects for better UX\n\n✅ **COACH-UI-002** - Recommendation Details Modal\n- Full-screen modal for detailed recommendation info\n- Priority badge and type indicator\n- Metrics grid (confidence, impact, effort)\n- Implementation instructions section\n- Dismiss and \"Mark as Implemented\" buttons\n\n🔲 **REPORT-001** - Client Report Generation\n🔲 **REPORT-002** - PDF Report Export\n🔲 **REPORT-003** - Email Report Delivery\n🔲 **REPORT-004** - Report Scheduling & Automation\n\n### Phase 6: Deployment & Maintenance (2/6)","originalFile":"# MetaCoach Implementation Status\n\n## Overview\nMetaCoach is a comprehensive Meta Ads coaching platform that analyzes ad performance and provides intelligent recommendations to optimize campaigns.\n\n**Status: 32/52 features completed (61.5%)**\n\n## Session Update\n**Latest Session (Apr 17, 2026):** Added complete coaching dashboard UI with performance charts, recommendations panel, and modal for detailed views. All dashboard components now functional and displaying real Meta Ads data.\n\n## Completed Features\n\n### Phase 1: Core Infrastructure & Authentication (6/6)\n✅ **INFRA-001** - Supabase Database Schema Setup\n- Created comprehensive database schema with users, meta_accounts, ads, metrics, recommendations, alerts tables\n- Implemented RLS policies for data security\n- Set up indexes for query performance\n\n✅ **AUTH-001** - User Signup Implementation\n- Email/password registration with validation\n- User profile creation in Supabase\n- Secure password hashing\n\n✅ **AUTH-002** - User Login Implementation\n- Session management with JWT tokens\n- Secure HTTP-only cookies\n- Token refresh handling\n\n✅ **AUTH-003** - Password Reset Flow\n- Forgot password email flow\n- Secure token-based reset\n- Session invalidation on password change\n\n✅ **API-001** - API Health Endpoint\n- `/api/health` endpoint for monitoring\n- Database connectivity checks\n- Service status reporting\n\n✅ **API-002** - Request Authentication Middleware\n- JWT token verification\n- Protected route wrapper\n- User context injection\n\n### Phase 2: Meta API Integration (3/4)\n✅ **META-001** - Meta OAuth Integration Setup\n- OAuth 2.0 flow with CSRF protection\n- Long-lived token exchange\n- Account token storage in Supabase\n\n✅ **META-002** - Meta Ad Accounts List Endpoint\n- `/api/meta/accounts` endpoint\n- Account enrichment with current balance\n- Token expiration handling\n\n✅ **META-003** - Account Connection & Linking\n- Multiple account support\n- Account switching\n- Token refresh mechanisms\n\n🔲 **META-004** - Campaign Data Sync from Meta\n- Campaign and ad set sync endpoint\n- Historical data retrieval\n\n### Phase 3: Ad Performance Analysis (4/4)\n✅ **PERF-001** - Ad Performance Metrics Fetch\n- `/api/meta/metrics/fetch` endpoint\n- Daily performance metrics from Meta API\n- CTR, CPC, CPA, ROAS calculation\n\n✅ **PERF-002** - Performance Trending & Time Series\n- Trend analysis algorithms\n- Moving average calculations\n- Percent change tracking\n\n✅ **PERF-003** - Performance Anomaly Detection\n- Statistical outlier detection\n- Threshold-based alerts\n- Anomaly severity scoring\n\n✅ **PERF-004** - Budget & Spend Tracking\n- Spend vs. budget comparison\n- Daily pacing calculations\n- Budget overspend alerts\n\n### Phase 4: Coaching Recommendation System (6/6)\n✅ **COACH-001** - Recommendation Engine Core\n- Rules-based recommendation generation\n- Multiple recommendation types (budget, creative, audience, targeting)\n- `/api/recommendations/generate` endpoint\n\n✅ **COACH-002** - Budget Optimization Recommendations\n- High/low performer identification\n- Budget increase/decrease suggestions\n- ROI impact estimation\n\n✅ **COACH-003** - Creative Refresh Recommendations\n- Ad fatigue detection\n- Creative rotation suggestions\n- A/B test recommendations\n\n✅ **COACH-004** - Audience Targeting Recommendations\n- High-converting audience identification\n- Lookalike audience suggestions\n- Targeting refinement recommendations\n\n✅ **COACH-005** - Recommendation Scoring & Ranking\n- Impact score calculation (0-100)\n- Effort/implementation cost estimation\n- ROI projection and prioritization\n\n✅ **COACH-006** - Recommendation History & Tracking\n- `/api/recommendations/list` endpoint\n- `/api/recommendations/update` endpoint\n- Implementation status tracking\n\n### Deployment & Maintenance (4/4)\n✅ **DEPLOY-001** - Vercel Project Setup & Configuration\n- `vercel.json` configuration created\n- Environment variable setup\n- Build configuration optimized\n\n✅ **MAINT-001** - Dependency Updates & Security\n- All vulnerabilities fixed (0 found)\n- Dependencies updated to latest safe versions\n- npm audit passing\n\n✅ **MAINT-002** - Code Quality & Linting\n- ESLint configured\n- TypeScript strict mode enabled\n- Build warnings resolved\n\n✅ **DOC-001** - API Documentation\n- Endpoint specifications documented\n- Request/response examples provided\n- Error codes documented\n\n## API Endpoints (26 total)\n\n### Authentication\n- `POST /api/auth/signup` - User registration\n- `POST /api/auth/login` - User login\n- `POST /api/auth/logout` - User logout\n- `POST /api/auth/forgot-password` - Password reset request\n- `POST /api/auth/reset-password` - Password reset completion\n\n### Health & Monitoring\n- `GET /api/health` - Application health check\n- `GET /api/meta/health` - Meta API health check\n\n### Meta API Integration\n- `GET /api/meta/oauth/start` - OAuth flow initiation\n- `GET /api/meta/oauth/callback` - OAuth callback handler\n- `GET /api/meta/accounts` - List user's ad accounts\n- `POST /api/meta/sync/campaigns` - Sync campaign data\n- `GET /api/meta/metrics/fetch` - Fetch performance metrics\n\n### Recommendations\n- `GET /api/recommendations/generate` - Generate recommendations\n- `GET /api/recommendations/list` - Retrieve recommendations\n- `POST /api/recommendations/update` - Update recommendation status\n- `PATCH /api/recommendations/update` - Patch recommendation\n\n### Meta Business Integration\n- `POST /api/meta/business-login/start` - Business account login\n- `GET /api/meta/business-login/callback` - Business login callback\n- `POST /api/meta/business-login/store-token` - Store business token\n- `GET /api/meta/me` - Get current user info\n- `GET /api/meta/ads/accounts` - List ad accounts\n- `GET /api/meta/ads/campaigns` - List campaigns\n- `GET /api/meta/media` - Get media items\n- `GET /api/meta/comments` - Get comments\n- `GET /api/meta/facebook/posts` - Get FB posts\n- `GET /api/meta/threads` - Get Threads posts\n- `POST /api/facebook/data-deletion` - Data deletion handler\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **Frontend**: Next.js 16.1.1 with React 19.2.3\n- **Backend**: Next.js API Routes\n- **Database**: Supabase (PostgreSQL)\n- **Authentication**: Supabase Auth + JWT\n- **Meta Integration**: Meta Graph API v21.0\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4.0\n- **Utilities**: Zod (validation), Jose (JWT), Axios (HTTP)\n\n## Environment Configuration\n\nRequired environment variables:\n```\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\nSUPABASE_JWT_SECRET\nMETA_APP_ID\nMETA_APP_SECRET\nMETA_REDIRECT_URL\nPUBLIC_BASE_URL\n```\n\nSee `.env.example` for template.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/app\n  /api\n    /auth          - Authentication endpoints\n    /health        - Health check endpoints\n    /meta          - Meta API integration\n    /recommendations - Recommendation system\n  /dashboard       - Main dashboard page\n  /connect         - Account connection flow\n\n/lib\n  /auth-middleware.ts - JWT verification\n  /recommendation-engine.ts - Recommendation generation\n  /meta.ts - Meta API client\n  /supabase.ts - Supabase client\n  /types.ts - TypeScript types\n\n/components        - React components\n/docs              - Documentation\n```\n\n## Remaining Features (28)\n\n### Dashboard & UI (10 features)\n- Dashboard layout and navigation\n- Account selection & switching\n- Performance summary cards\n- Performance charting\n- Campaign performance table\n- Recommendations panel\n- Recommendation details modal\n- Report generation\n- Report scheduling\n- Alert system\n\n### Reporting (4 features)\n- Client report generation\n- PDF export\n- Email delivery\n- Report scheduling\n\n### Testing (6 features) - IMPLEMENTED ✅\n✅ **TEST-001** - Unit tests for auth validation\n- Zod validation schema tests for signup, login, and password reset\n- Coverage: 100% of validation logic\n- 13 validation tests passing\n\n✅ **TEST-002** - Unit tests for recommendation engine\n- Scoring and ranking tests\n- Impact-to-effort ratio calculations\n- Effort multiplier verification\n- Coverage: 20% of recommendation-engine.ts\n- 6 tests passing\n\n✅ **TEST-003** - Health check tests\n- Database connectivity verification\n- Latency metric testing\n- Uptime tracking\n- 3 tests passing\n\n✅ **TEST-004** - Auth middleware tests\n- Token extraction and validation\n- Authorization header parsing\n- Protected route logic\n- 7 tests passing\n\nNote: Additional integration tests (Meta API, database, E2E, performance) remain as future work\n\n### Monitoring (2 features)\n- Error tracking & logging\n- Performance monitoring\n\n### Additional Features (4 features)\n- Campaign cloning\n- A/B test recommendations\n- Competitive analysis\n- Budget auto-reallocation\n\n## Building & Deployment\n\n### Local Development\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n# Open http://localhost:4545\n```\n\n### Production Build\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpm start\n```\n\n### Vercel Deployment\n```bash\nvercel --prod\n```\n\nEnvironment variables must be configured in Vercel project settings.\n\n## Health Check\n\nTest the health endpoint:\n```bash\ncurl http://localhost:4545/api/health\n```\n\nExpected response:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"healthy\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-04-17T...\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"services\": {\n    \"database\": {\n      \"status\": \"up\",\n      \"latency_ms\": 42\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Dashboard UI** - Implement React components for dashboard\n2. **Testing** - Add unit and integration tests\n3. **Reporting** - Implement client report generation\n4. **Monitoring** - Add error tracking and performance monitoring\n5. **Additional Features** - Campaign cloning, A/B testing, etc.\n\n## Known Limitations\n\n- OAuth token refresh not yet implemented (tokens last 60 days)\n- Limited demographic breakdowns for recommendations\n- Dashboard UI not yet implemented\n- Email reports not yet functional\n- Real-time alerts not yet implemented\n\n## Support & Documentation\n\n- API documentation: See `/docs/api.md`\n- Setup guide: See `GET_ACCESS_TOKEN.md`\n- Deployment: See `DEPLOYMENT.md`\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: April 17, 2026\n**Build Status**: ✅ Passing\n**Tests**: ✅ 29 tests passing (4 test suites)\n**Vulnerabilities**: 0 found\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":113,"oldLines":7,"newStart":113,"newLines":59,"lines":[" - `/api/recommendations/update` endpoint"," - Implementation status tracking"," ","-### Deployment & Maintenance (4/4)","+### Phase 5: Client Dashboard & Reporting (7/12)","+✅ **DASH-001** - Dashboard Layout & Navigation","+- Main dashboard page with header and controls","+- Responsive grid layout","+- Account selector and time period controls","+- Clean, professional UI design","+","+✅ **DASH-002** - Account Selection & Switching","+- Dropdown selector for linked Meta ad accounts","+- Real-time metric updates on account switch","+- Account balance and currency display","+- Add account button for linking new accounts","+","+✅ **DASH-003** - Performance Summary Cards","+- Display spend, impressions, clicks, conversions","+- Icon indicators for each metric","+- Large typography for easy scanning","+- Color-coded metric cards (blue, green, purple, orange)","+","+✅ **DASH-004** - Performance Chart & Graphing","+- Interactive line charts using Recharts library","+- Support for spend, impressions, clicks, conversions","+- 7/30/90 day timeframe selector","+- Metric selector dropdown","+- Summary statistics (avg, peak, total) below chart","+","+✅ **DASH-005** - Campaign Performance Table","+- Table showing all campaigns with status","+- Status badges (ACTIVE/PAUSED)","+- Campaign objectives displayed","+- Responsive horizontal scrolling","+- Pagination for 100+ campaigns","+","+✅ **COACH-UI-001** - Recommendations Panel & Display","+- Top 5 recommendations displayed in list","+- Priority color indicators (high/medium/low)","+- Confidence scores and impact percentages","+- Clickable items to view details","+- Hover effects for better UX","+","+✅ **COACH-UI-002** - Recommendation Details Modal","+- Full-screen modal for detailed recommendation info","+- Priority badge and type indicator","+- Metrics grid (confidence, impact, effort)","+- Implementation instructions section","+- Dismiss and \"Mark as Implemented\" buttons","+","+🔲 **REPORT-001** - Client Report Generation","+🔲 **REPORT-002** - PDF Report Export","+🔲 **REPORT-003** - Email Report Delivery","+🔲 **REPORT-004** - Report Scheduling & Automation","+","+### Phase 6: Deployment & Maintenance (2/6)"," ✅ **DEPLOY-001** - Vercel Project Setup & Configuration"," - `vercel.json` configuration created"," - Environment variable setup"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
