nceChart.tsx` - Recharts-based performance visualization\n- `README_IMPLEMENTATION.md` - Updated feature documentation\n- `package.json` - Added recharts library\n\n### 🚀 Ready for Production\nThe application is fully deployable to Vercel with:\n- All environment variables configured in `vercel.json`\n- API health checks working\n- Zero security vulnerabilities\n- TypeScript type safety enabled\n- Professional UI/UX ready for end users\n\nThe dashboard is fully functional and can be deployed immediately. The next priorities would be report generation (REPORT-001-004), email alerts, and additional E2E tests."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":159391,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a7a6962-707b-432a-94ba-10b2e85c8b93","uuid":"247f2dd6-db56-4b96-b0b0-fc7a2ced57fe"}
